# Phase 11 Search, DB state "fresh / rebuilding" (docs/phase11-brief.md
# section 6 item 10): with no RAM cache yet no rows show and the
# "Updating Library..." footer explains (8b; the top row has no second
# line, never "No Search Results"); typing waits; once the library is ready
# the search runs on its own (no key needed) and the results show.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-search-updating.script
# needs: library
# fresh-db
# golden: skip

wait 1500           # the main menu, the shell building the database
key SELECT          # Music
wait 600
wheel +8 300        # "Search"
wait 300
key SELECT
wait 600
shot updating       # Search, the strip, the footer
type h
wait 300
shot typed_waiting  # "h" typed, still the footer, no rows
wait_db 45000
wait 2500           # the screen's 1 s poll notices, the search runs
shot results        # Results for: h, rows
quit
